{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 2180,
    "dDurationMs": 3260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- This is a video about things like cars,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5440,
    "dDurationMs": 3710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "phones, and light bulbs\nand an actual conspiracy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 9150,
    "dDurationMs": 1443,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that made them worse."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12390,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This video was sponsored by NordVPN,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 14760,
    "dDurationMs": 2890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "more about them at the end of the video"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 17650,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I am outside Livermore\nFire Station, number six."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21130,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And in here, they have the longest,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 23650,
    "dDurationMs": 3250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "continuously on light bulb in the world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 26900,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It has been on for 120 years"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30540,
    "dDurationMs": 1270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "since 1901."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 31810,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There it is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 32643,
    "dDurationMs": 1387,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Host] Yeah, that's it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 34030,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It's not even connected\nto a light switch"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36700,
    "dDurationMs": 2510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it does have a backup\nbattery and generator."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 39210,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the big question is,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 40650,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how has this light bulb lasted so long?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 43430,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was manufactured by hand not long"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 45890,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "after commercial light\nbulbs were first invented,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 48510,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And yet, it has been running\nfor over a million hours,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 52080,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "way longer than any light\nbulb today is meant to last."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 55580,
    "dDurationMs": 2510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Awhile back, a friend of\nmine told me this story,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 58090,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that someone had invented a light bulb"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 60550,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that would last forever years ago,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 62890,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but they never sold it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 64420,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because an everlasting light bulb makes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 66140,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for a terrible business model."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 68030,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, you would never\nhave any repeat customers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 70640,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and eventually you would run out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 72160,
    "dDurationMs": 2470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of people to sell light bulbs to,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 74630,
    "dDurationMs": 2060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I thought this story sounded ridiculous."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 76690,
    "dDurationMs": 2450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you could make an\neverlasting light bulb,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79140,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then everyone would buy your light bulb"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 81040,
    "dDurationMs": 1390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "over the competitors."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82430,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so you could charge\nreally high prices,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 84260,
    "dDurationMs": 3810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "make a lot of money, even if\ndemand would eventually dry up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 88070,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I just couldn't imagine that\nwe had better light bulbs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 90590,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the past and then\nintentionally made them worse,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 94260,
    "dDurationMs": 3020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it turns out I was wrong."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 97280,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At least sort of."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 99530,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Inventing a viable\nelectric light was hard,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 102860,
    "dDurationMs": 2230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, this is the typical\nincandescent design,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 105090,
    "dDurationMs": 1870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which just involves\npassing electric current"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 106960,
    "dDurationMs": 4270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "through a material making\nit so hot that it glows,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 111230,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "less than 5% of the electrical\nenergy comes out as light."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 114950,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The other 95% is released as heat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 118170,
    "dDurationMs": 2020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So these are really heat bulbs,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 120190,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which give off a little bit\nof light as a by-product."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 123510,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The temperature of the filament\ncan get up to 2,800 Kelvin."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127450,
    "dDurationMs": 3770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is half as hot as\nthe surface of the sun."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 131220,
    "dDurationMs": 3269,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At temperatures like\nthose, most materials melt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 134489,
    "dDurationMs": 1261,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- That's so cool.\n- And if they don't melt,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 135750,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they burn,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 137190,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is why in the 1840s,\nWarren De la Rue came"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 140340,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "up with the idea of putting\nthe filament in a vacuum bulb,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 143190,
    "dDurationMs": 2930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so there's no oxygen to react with."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 146120,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By 1879, Thomas Edison had made a bulb"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 149160,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with a cotton thread filament\nthat lasted 14 hours."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 153800,
    "dDurationMs": 2750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Other inventors created\nbulbs with platinum filaments"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156550,
    "dDurationMs": 2090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or other carbonized materials."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 158640,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And gradually, the lifespan\nof bulbs increased."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 162520,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The filaments changed\nfrom carbon to tungsten,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 165430,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which has a very high melting point."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 167650,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And by the early 1920s,\naverage bulb lifetimes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 170610,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "were approaching 2,000 hours\nwith some lasting 2,500 hours."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176020,
    "dDurationMs": 3340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But this is when lifetimes\nstopped getting longer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 179360,
    "dDurationMs": 2470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and started getting shorter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 181830,
    "dDurationMs": 3790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In Geneva, Switzerland just\nbefore Christmas, 1924,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 185620,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there was a secret\nmeeting of top executives"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 188120,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from the world's leading\nlight bulb companies,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 190640,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Phillips, International General Electric,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 193340,
    "dDurationMs": 2680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Tokyo Electric, OSRAM from Germany,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 196020,
    "dDurationMs": 3530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the UK's Associated\nElectric among others."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 199550,
    "dDurationMs": 1520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They formed what became known"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 201070,
    "dDurationMs": 3550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as the Phoebus Cartel named after Phoebus,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 204620,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the Greek God of light."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 206840,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There, all these companies agreed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 208880,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to work together to help each other"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 211740,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by controlling the world\nsupply of light bulbs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 216140,
    "dDurationMs": 2030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the early days of\nthe electrical industry,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 218170,
    "dDurationMs": 1630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there had been lots of different"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 219800,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "small light bulb manufacturers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 221800,
    "dDurationMs": 2950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but by now they had\nlargely been consolidated"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 224750,
    "dDurationMs": 1790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "into these big corporations,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 226540,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "each dominant in a\nparticular part of the world."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 229480,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The biggest threat they all faced was"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 231400,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from longer lasting light bulbs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 233770,
    "dDurationMs": 4887,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example, in 1923, OSRAM\nsold 63 million light bulbs,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 238657,
    "dDurationMs": 3523,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the following year\nthey sold only 28 million."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 242180,
    "dDurationMs": 4070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Light bulbs were lasting\ntoo long, eating into sales."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 246250,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So all the companies in the cartel agreed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 248800,
    "dDurationMs": 2380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to reduce the lifespan of their bulbs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 251180,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to 1,000 hours cutting the\nexisting average almost in half."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 257990,
    "dDurationMs": 1810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But how could each company ensure"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 259800,
    "dDurationMs": 2830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that the other companies would\nactually follow the rules"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 262630,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and make shorter lasting light bulb."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 265000,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After all, it would be in each\nof their individual interests"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 267480,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to make a better product\nto outsell the others?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 270760,
    "dDurationMs": 2140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, to enforce the 1,000 hour limit,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 272900,
    "dDurationMs": 2630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "each of the manufacturers\nhave to send in sample bulbs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 275530,
    "dDurationMs": 3940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from their factories and they\nwere tested on big test stands"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 279470,
    "dDurationMs": 1610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like this one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 281080,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If a bulb lasted"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 282460,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "significantly longer than\n1,000 thousand hours,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 285060,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then the company was fined."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 287180,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If a bulb lasted longer than 3000 hours,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 290260,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "well the fine was 200 Swiss Francs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 292680,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for every 1,000 bulbs sold."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 295530,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And there are records"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 296670,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of these fines being issued to companies."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 299850,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But how do you make a worst\nlight bulb in the first place?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 303690,
    "dDurationMs": 2410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, the same engineers who\nhad previously been tasked"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 306100,
    "dDurationMs": 3230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with extending the lifespan\nnow had to find ways"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 309330,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to decrease it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 310650,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So they tried different materials,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 312660,
    "dDurationMs": 2590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "different shaped filaments,\nand thinner connections."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 315250,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if you look at the\ndata, they were successful."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 318410,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ever since the formation of the cartel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 320300,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the lifespan of light\nbulbs steadily decreased."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 323400,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So that by 1934, the average\nlifespan was just 1,205 hours."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 329510,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And just as they had\nplanned, sales increased"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 332310,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for cartel members by 25% in\nthe four years after 1926."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 337720,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And even though the cost\nof components came down,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 340390,
    "dDurationMs": 3130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the cartel kept prices\nvirtually unchanged,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 343520,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so they increased their profit margins."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 346400,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So did people know that\nthe light bulb companies"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 349200,
    "dDurationMs": 3130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "were conspiring together to\nmake their products worse?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 352330,
    "dDurationMs": 4210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No, the Phoebus Cartel\nclaimed that its purpose was"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 356540,
    "dDurationMs": 3820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to increase standardization\nand efficiency of light bulbs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 360360,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, they did establish\nthis screw thread is standard."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 363460,
    "dDurationMs": 1990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can find it on\nvirtually all light bulbs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 365450,
    "dDurationMs": 1790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "around the world now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 367240,
    "dDurationMs": 2630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But all evidence points to\nthe cartels being motivated"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 369870,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by profits and increased sales,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 372210,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not by what was best for consumers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 375090,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So one of the reasons this\nlight bulb has lasted so long is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 378240,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because it was made before the cartel era."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 381520,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Another reason is because the\nfilament has always been run"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 384420,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at low power, just four or five watts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 387640,
    "dDurationMs": 1510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was meant to be a nightlight"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 389150,
    "dDurationMs": 2950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for the fire station to\nprovide just enough light"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 392100,
    "dDurationMs": 3140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that firemen wouldn't\nrun into things at night."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 395240,
    "dDurationMs": 1130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the fact that it was always"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 396370,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on reduced the thermal cycling"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 398250,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the filament and components\nlimiting the stress caused"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 401220,
    "dDurationMs": 2373,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by thermal expansion and contraction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 404750,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Phoebus Cartel was\ninitially planned to last"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 407420,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at least until 1955, but\nit fell apart in the 1930s."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 412580,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was already struggling\ndue to outside competition."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 415500,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And non-compliance amongst\nsome of its members,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 418200,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the outbreak of World War II is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 420030,
    "dDurationMs": 1930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "really what finished it off."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 421960,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this cartel was dead,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 424600,
    "dDurationMs": 3220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but its methods survived to this day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 427820,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are lots of companies out there"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 429650,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that intentionally shortened\nthe lifespan of their products"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 433010,
    "dDurationMs": 3663,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's a tactic known now\nas planned obsolescence."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 437716,
    "dDurationMs": 2684,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This was actually the\nsubject of Casey Neistat's"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 440400,
    "dDurationMs": 3237,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "first viral video all\nthe way back in 2003."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 443637,
    "dDurationMs": 2203,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Support] Thank you for\ncalling Apple, my name is Ryan."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 445840,
    "dDurationMs": 1550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "May I have your first name please?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 447390,
    "dDurationMs": 890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Casey] Casey."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 448280,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Support] ] All right, and what seems"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 449113,
    "dDurationMs": 900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to be the issue today?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 450013,
    "dDurationMs": 2747,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Casey] I have an iPod that\nI bought about 18 months ago"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 452760,
    "dDurationMs": 2409,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the battery is dead on it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 455169,
    "dDurationMs": 1731,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Support] 18 months,\nokay, it's past it year,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 456900,
    "dDurationMs": 2890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which basically means there'll be a charge"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 459790,
    "dDurationMs": 4600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of $255 plus a mailing\nfee to send it to us"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 464390,
    "dDurationMs": 2650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to refurbish, to correct it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 467040,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But at that price, you might\nas well go get a new one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 471060,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Narrator] This video\ngot millions of views"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 473360,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in a time before YouTube or social media."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 476160,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it spawned a class action lawsuit,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 478480,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which Apple settled out of court,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 481000,
    "dDurationMs": 1240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it didn't stop the company"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 482240,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from practicing planned obsolescence."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 484500,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After an iOS update in 2017,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 487320,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "users of older iPhones found apps loading"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 489820,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "significantly slower or the\ndevice shutting down altogether."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 494020,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Apple said they throttled\nperformance to protect the battery"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 497340,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of older devices and\nincrease their longevity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 500510,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Of course, that wouldn't be an issue"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 502150,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if the battery were replaceable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 504760,
    "dDurationMs": 3050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In a series of lawsuits\nthat concluded in 2020,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 507810,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Apple was fined or reached settlements"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 510010,
    "dDurationMs": 3370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to pay hundreds of millions of dollars,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 513380,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "undoubtedly, this amount\npales in comparison"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 516020,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the extra revenue they generate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 517660,
    "dDurationMs": 2683,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by limiting the lifespan\nof their products."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 522130,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But some would argue that\nplanned obsolescence isn't"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 524680,
    "dDurationMs": 4530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just about greed, but that\nit's also good for everyone."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 529210,
    "dDurationMs": 2560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "During the great depression in the 1930s"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 531770,
    "dDurationMs": 2934,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when as much as 1/4 of\nAmericans were out of work"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 534704,
    "dDurationMs": 2616,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and real estate broker Bernard London"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 537320,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "proposed mandatory planned obsolescence"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 540180,
    "dDurationMs": 1430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as a way to get people back to work"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 541610,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and lift America out of the depression."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 544070,
    "dDurationMs": 2540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He wrote, \"I would have the\ngovernment assign a lease"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 546610,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of life to shoes, and homes, and machines"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 549710,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when they are first created"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 551470,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they would be sold\nand used within the term"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 553790,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of their existence, definitely\nknown by the consumer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 557350,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "After the allotted time had expired,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 559270,
    "dDurationMs": 2470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "these things would be legally dead"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 561740,
    "dDurationMs": 1670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and would be controlled by the duly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 563410,
    "dDurationMs": 3110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "appointed governmental\nagency and destroyed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 566520,
    "dDurationMs": 2890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if there is widespread unemployment.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 569410,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, this might sound\nlike a wild fringe idea,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 572490,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but people were clearly afraid\nof being put out of work"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 575250,
    "dDurationMs": 4190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by technological progress and\nproducts that were too good."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 579440,
    "dDurationMs": 3177,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There was even a popular\nOscar nominated film about it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 582617,
    "dDurationMs": 4543,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"This is the man in the\nwhite suit from 1951.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 587160,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's about a scientist who\ninvents the perfect fiber."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 590260,
    "dDurationMs": 2410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It won't stain or break, or fray."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 592670,
    "dDurationMs": 990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I think I've succeeded"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 593660,
    "dDurationMs": 2530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the copolymerization\nof amino acid residues"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 596190,
    "dDurationMs": 3703,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and carbohydrate molecules,\nboth containing ionic groups."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 601010,
    "dDurationMs": 1340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's really perfectly simple."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 602350,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Narrator] The Academy\naward nomination was"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 604240,
    "dDurationMs": 3443,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for best screenplay, I kid you not."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 608690,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Anyway, everyone is initially excited"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 611210,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about our heroes scientific discovery."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 613640,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He makes a suit out of the\nthread and it has to be white"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 616580,
    "dDurationMs": 1690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because the fiber is so stain resistant,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 618270,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it can't even be dyed,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 620040,
    "dDurationMs": 2420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but this is when trouble strikes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 622460,
    "dDurationMs": 2950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the factory owners realize\nthey won't be able to sell"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 625410,
    "dDurationMs": 2650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as much of this thread\nbecause it's so durable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 628060,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the workers worry it'll\nput them out of a job."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 630730,
    "dDurationMs": 4193,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Why can't you scientists\nleave things alone?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 636570,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What about my better washing\nwhen there's no washing to do?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 640770,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- This is when you get the climactic scene"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 642720,
    "dDurationMs": 3290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where factory workers and\nfactory owners team up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 646010,
    "dDurationMs": 2690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to chase down the scientist to destroy him"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 648700,
    "dDurationMs": 1850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and his invention."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 650550,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And believe it or not, this\nmovie may have been inspired"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 653610,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by real events."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 655140,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the 1940s, the synthetic\nfiber nylon replaced silk"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 659040,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in stockings, and it was so durable"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 661260,
    "dDurationMs": 2750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that the products became\nan overnight sensation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 664010,
    "dDurationMs": 2540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There were literal riots when women tried"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 666550,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to get their hands on them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 668200,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When the manufacturers realized"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 670090,
    "dDurationMs": 2230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they had made the product too good,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 672320,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they didn't destroy the fiber,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 674480,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but they did follow the\nexample of the Phoebus Cartel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 677640,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They instructed their\nengineers and scientists"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 680070,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to find ways to weaken the\nproduct to shorten its lifespan,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 683710,
    "dDurationMs": 2510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so people would have to buy more."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 686220,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, it seems like consumers\nare finally fighting back"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 689020,
    "dDurationMs": 1750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "against planned obsolescence."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 690770,
    "dDurationMs": 3530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the European union and\nin over 25 states in the US,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 694300,
    "dDurationMs": 1550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there's proposed legislation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 695850,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to enshrine the right to repair."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 698730,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And these laws would force manufacturers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 700620,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to make it easier to\nrepair their products."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 703480,
    "dDurationMs": 2650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They would have to provide\ninformation and access to parts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 706130,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you could replace a battery\nor fix a cracked screen"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 709130,
    "dDurationMs": 3190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at a third-party repair shop\nwithout voiding your warranty."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 712320,
    "dDurationMs": 2770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if right to repair does become law,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 715090,
    "dDurationMs": 1780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "does that mean artificial obsolescence"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 716870,
    "dDurationMs": 1700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "will be gone for good?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 718570,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sadly, no, because there is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 720850,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one last thing manufacturers can use"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 722970,
    "dDurationMs": 3944,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to make their products\nobsolete, which is you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 726914,
    "dDurationMs": 1696,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(instrumental music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 728610,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Henry Ford released the\nfirst mass market car,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 731220,
    "dDurationMs": 2210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the model T in 1908."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 733430,
    "dDurationMs": 2500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And he envisioned it like a workhorse,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 735930,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "an affordable tool that wouldn't wear out,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 738270,
    "dDurationMs": 2410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a bit like the everlasting light bulb."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 740680,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In 1922 Ford said, \"We want the\nman who buys one of our cars"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 744680,
    "dDurationMs": 3010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "never to have to buy another,\nwe never make an improvement"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 747690,
    "dDurationMs": 2777,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that renders any previous model obsolete.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 751390,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But by 1920, 55% of American\nfamilies already owned a car."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 756420,
    "dDurationMs": 3200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nearly everyone that\ncould afford one had one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 759620,
    "dDurationMs": 1120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that same year,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 760740,
    "dDurationMs": 2870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there was a small economic\ndownturn driving down sales"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 763610,
    "dDurationMs": 2703,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for both Ford and General Motors."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 767530,
    "dDurationMs": 4040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In 1921, DuPont, the chemical\nand paint company took"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 771570,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "over the controlling\nshare in General Motors."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 774270,
    "dDurationMs": 1360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And they started experimenting"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 775630,
    "dDurationMs": 2260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with painting cars different colors,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 777890,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "up until then, Henry Ford had said,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 779840,
    "dDurationMs": 2060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you could have whatever color you like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 781900,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so long as it's black."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 784270,
    "dDurationMs": 3530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It took a couple of years\nof testing, but in 1924,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 787800,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "GM released their first\ncars in different colors."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 790890,
    "dDurationMs": 2210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And soon after, they introduced a trick"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 793100,
    "dDurationMs": 2930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that feels very familiar now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 796030,
    "dDurationMs": 850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Each new year,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 796880,
    "dDurationMs": 3123,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they would introduce\ncars in different colors."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 801090,
    "dDurationMs": 3370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The goal wasn't just to make\nFord's model T lookout dated,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 804460,
    "dDurationMs": 2860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but to make their own cars\nfeel outdated every year"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 807320,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "encouraging customers to\ntrade in their old cars"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 810530,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for shiny new ones."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 812210,
    "dDurationMs": 2620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Years later, GM's head\nof design, Harley Earl,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 814830,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "candidly discussed his role in creating"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 816910,
    "dDurationMs": 2877,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what he called dynamic obsolescence."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 819787,
    "dDurationMs": 2963,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Our big job is to hasten obsolescence."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 822750,
    "dDurationMs": 3830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In 1934, the average car\nownership span was five years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 826580,
    "dDurationMs": 3860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, which was 1955, it is two years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 830440,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When it is one year, we\nwill have a perfect score."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 834340,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By the time he said this,\nGeneral Motors was the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 837100,
    "dDurationMs": 3650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "most valuable company in\nthe world and it's sold half"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 840750,
    "dDurationMs": 2973,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of all vehicles purchased\nin the US every year."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 847390,
    "dDurationMs": 2470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These days, the world's\nmost valuable company,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 849860,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Apple, seems to have copied\ndirectly out of this playbook."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 853220,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, new styles every year, check,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 855520,
    "dDurationMs": 2750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "new special colors every year, check,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 858270,
    "dDurationMs": 3040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "marginal technological improvement, check."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 861310,
    "dDurationMs": 3690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, is this useful\ninnovation or just a gimmick?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 865000,
    "dDurationMs": 3630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The inspiration for General\nMotors and hence for Apple comes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 868630,
    "dDurationMs": 4490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from fashion where real\ninnovation is all but impossible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 873120,
    "dDurationMs": 2810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the only way to make\npeople feel the urgency"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 875930,
    "dDurationMs": 2930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to get out there and\nbuy is to create styles"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 878860,
    "dDurationMs": 2450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that last but one season."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 881310,
    "dDurationMs": 1480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The trouble then is you run"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 882790,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "through these styles too quickly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 884260,
    "dDurationMs": 1730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then what are you supposed to do?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 885990,
    "dDurationMs": 3730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, just recycle the styles\nfrom a few decades ago."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 889720,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The iPhone also shows\nthis recycling trend."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 893040,
    "dDurationMs": 2150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, just look at\nthe way the edges were"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 895190,
    "dDurationMs": 3010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "initially rounded and\nthen they were squared off"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 898200,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then they were rounded again"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 899840,
    "dDurationMs": 1570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and now, they're squared off."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 901410,
    "dDurationMs": 940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And how much do you want to bet"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 902350,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that the iPhone 14 has rounded edges?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 905270,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think the point is that\nwith design and styling,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 907880,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there is no best, there's only different,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 911050,
    "dDurationMs": 2060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is apparently enough to remind us"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 913110,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that we don't have the\nlatest and greatest,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 915120,
    "dDurationMs": 2150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so we have to rush\nout and keep buying."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 919120,
    "dDurationMs": 1820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The only type of obsolescence"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 920940,
    "dDurationMs": 2660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we should support is technological,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 923600,
    "dDurationMs": 2950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which brings us back to the light bulb."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 926550,
    "dDurationMs": 2210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the last 20 years,\nlight bulbs have gone"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 928760,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from incandescent, which\nwas basically unchanged"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 931840,
    "dDurationMs": 2390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for 100 years to compact fluorescent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 934230,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And now, to LED, these use\njust a 10th of the energy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 938990,
    "dDurationMs": 3633,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and can last anywhere from\n10 to 50 times longer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 944130,
    "dDurationMs": 1210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, that's pretty bright."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 945340,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you're more likely to sell your house"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 948780,
    "dDurationMs": 1990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than to have to replace an LED bulb"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 950770,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that you've installed inside it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 953380,
    "dDurationMs": 2300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So we finally reached the point"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 955680,
    "dDurationMs": 3293,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of what is essentially an\neverlasting light bulb?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 958973,
    "dDurationMs": 2583,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(upbeat music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 965510,
    "dDurationMs": 3410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hey, this video was sponsored by NordVPN."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 968920,
    "dDurationMs": 2547,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I am featured in an episode\nof the British TV program,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 971467,
    "dDurationMs": 2423,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"QI,\" it's a show I really like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 973890,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I'd highly recommend it if\nyou haven't seen it already."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 976290,
    "dDurationMs": 3700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it's on Netflix, but\nonly if you're in the UK."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 979990,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I feel like TV and film are still trapped"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 982170,
    "dDurationMs": 1630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in antiquated business models"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 983800,
    "dDurationMs": 2900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where they divide up the world\ninto broadcast territories"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 986700,
    "dDurationMs": 1370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that doesn't make a lot of sense"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 988070,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "now that information can flow\nfreely through the Internet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 991240,
    "dDurationMs": 3070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Luckily using NordVPN,\nanyone can set their location"
    } ]
  }, {
